interface.longDescription:
Hoplix is a print-on-demand platform based in Italy: sellers put their designs on t-shirts, hoodies, mugs, bags and many other products, and Hoplix prints and ships every order with no minimum quantity.

With this plugin you can work on your Hoplix account from the chat:
- browse the catalogue with colours, sizes, base costs and production times;
- create campaigns with your design (public with their own page, or private for your own orders): upload the image through a personal Hoplix link, no public URL needed;
- calculate a quote with total and shipping cost before ordering;
- place orders with your own unique reference, or test orders that are checked and priced but never produced;
- follow orders with status, shipping code and tracking link, and cancel orders not yet in production.

Nothing is charged from the chat: orders are created unpaid and go into production only after you pay them from the Orders page of your Hoplix account (the payment link is also sent by email). You sign in on the Hoplix page with your Hoplix account and can disconnect at any time from Account > Integrations > MCP Integration.
